History

LinSCP began as a fork of WinSCP. The WinSCP-derived code has been removed
from this source tree; it survives only in the git history, where those old
commits stay under the GNU General Public License version 3. The files in the
current tree are LinSCP's own work, apart from the PuTTY components named
above, and are licensed as described in LICENSE.


Privacy

This program does not collect or transmit usage statistics, and it does not
contact any vendor server for update checks or installation reports. Beyond
that, the only network traffic it generates is the file transfer traffic you
start yourself.
